R04 HEB300 esp 2.0m tricouche H=4m
*Cas de démonstration K-Retain / RIDO : sol fictif, valeurs d'illustration
*Profilé HEB 300, fouille de 4 m, fiche de 6 m, trois couches, delta = 0
*Fichier indépendant de toute feuille Excel (structure du fichier RIDO fourni)
*Autostable
*Provisoire
#TN = 136.6
#FF = 132.6
#NAPPE = 118
#Z0 = 136.6
#Zf = 126.6
*Profilé HEB300 : I en cm4, h et b en m, W en cm3
#I = 25170
#esp = 2
#EI = 2.1*I/esp
#b = 0.3
#h = 0.3
#W = 1680
Z0 0
Zf EI 0 W
TN
*Couche 1 : Remblai
#Zb1 = 135.6
#Ga1 = 18
#Gd1 = 8
#EM1 = 3
#Al1 = 0.5
#Ph1 = 25
#Co1 = 0
#Da1 = 0
#Dp1 = 0
#C1 = 2*(EM1*1000/Al1)^(4/3)/(EI^(1/3))
#P1 = 6*EM1*1000/(4*0.6/3/b*(2.65*b/0.6)^Al1+Al1)/esp
#P1 = (b>=0.6)*P1
#P1bis= 6*EM1*1000/(4/3*2.65^Al1+Al1)/esp
#P1bis = (b<0.6)*P1bis
#Re1 = min(C1;max(P1;P1bis))
Zb1 Ga1 Gd1 0 0 0 Ph1 Co1
+ Da1 Dp1 Re1
*Couche 2 : Limon
#Zb2 = 133
#Ga2 = 19
#Gd2 = 9
#EM2 = 6
#Al2 = 0.5
#Ph2 = 27
#Co2 = 8
#Da2 = 0
#Dp2 = 0
#C2 = 2*(EM2*1000/Al2)^(4/3)/(EI^(1/3))
#P2 = 6*EM2*1000/(4*0.6/3/b*(2.65*b/0.6)^Al2+Al2)/esp
#P2 = (b>=0.6)*P2
#P2bis= 6*EM2*1000/(4/3*2.65^Al2+Al2)/esp
#P2bis = (b<0.6)*P2bis
#Re2 = min(C2;max(P2;P2bis))
Zb2 Ga2 Gd2 0 0 0 Ph2 Co2
+ Da2 Dp2 Re2
*Couche 3 : Sable graveleux
#Zb3 = 118
#Ga3 = 20
#Gd3 = 11
#EM3 = 25
#Al3 = 0.33
#Ph3 = 36
#Co3 = 0
#Da3 = 0
#Dp3 = 0
#C3 = 2*(EM3*1000/Al3)^(4/3)/(EI^(1/3))
#P3 = 6*EM3*1000/(4*0.6/3/b*(2.65*b/0.6)^Al3+Al3)/esp
#P3 = (b>=0.6)*P3
#P3bis= 6*EM3*1000/(4/3*2.65^Al3+Al3)/esp
#P3bis = (b<0.6)*P3bis
#Re3 = min(C3;max(P3;P3bis))
Zb3 Ga3 Gd3 0 0 0 Ph3 Co3
+ Da3 Dp3 Re3
NAPPE .05
*"Phase 1 - Excavation à FF
coe FF Zf min(1;(b+2*h)/esp)
ber(2) FF
cal(2)
*"Phase 1 - MEL
tel(0,1)
fap 1.00 1.35 1/1.10 1.00 1.00 1.50/1.35 1.35 1.00 1.00 1.00
*fap 
1.00 1.00 1/1.10/1.35 1.00 1.00 1.50/1.35 1.00 1.00 1.00 1.00
cal(2)
*"Phase 1 - ELU
tel(0,0)
fap 1.00 1.35 1/1.10 1.00 1.00 1.50/1.35 1.35 1.00 1.00 1.00
*fap 
1.00 1.00 1/1.10/1.35 1.00 1.00 1.50/1.35 1.00 1.00 1.00 1.00
cal(2)
fin
bIL
stop
